  m_text: "09-18\nBabalon Working is in progress. I must finish Ali's book on the
    matter.\n\n\n10-06\nHelena and I have finally finished our bunker project! It
    has many rooms. Three of which look almost identical! These should be reserved
    for both of us, and maybe a guest here and there. \n\nThis will entice Ron.   "
